000100* CUSTOMER-RECORD copybook.
000200* Shared by the customer maintenance programs.
000300 01  CUSTOMER-RECORD.
000400     05  CUST-ID             PIC 9(6) COMP-3.
000500     05  CUST-NAME.
000600         10  CUST-FIRST      PIC X(20).
000700         10  CUST-LAST       PIC X(30).
000800     05  CUST-ADDRESS.
000900         10  CUST-STREET     PIC X(30).
001000         10  CUST-CITY       PIC X(20).
001100         10  CUST-STATE      PIC X(02).
001200         10  CUST-ZIP        PIC X(10).
001300     05  CUST-BALANCE        PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
001400     05  FILLER              PIC X(08).
001500* Status flag and the condition-names defined over it.
001600     05  CUST-STATUS         PIC X.
001700         88  CUST-ACTIVE     VALUE "A".
001800         88  CUST-INACTIVE   VALUE "I".
001900         88  CUST-ARCHIVED   VALUE "R" THROUGH "Z".
002000     05  CUST-LIMIT          PIC 9(7)V99 USAGE COMP-3.
002100     05  CUST-COUNTERS.
002200         10  CUST-ORDERS     PIC 9(4) OCCURS 12 TIMES.
002300 66  CUST-NAME-KEY RENAMES CUST-FIRST THROUGH CUST-LAST.
002400 77  CUST-WORK-AREA          PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
002500* End of CUSTOMER-RECORD copybook.
